\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  ASIA:  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2 's Yen Buyers May Be Undeterred By  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 467 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 August 2011\par 13:31\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 -- Many Japanese market players will remain active yen buyers despite \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\par \par \uc2 -- Institutional investors must buy yen to hedge overseas investments\par \par \uc2 -- \b \highlight22\uc2 Intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has already put yen at attractive levels for exporters\par \par \uc2 By Andrew Monahan\par \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES\par \par \uc2 TOKYO (Dow Jones)--Japanese exporters, life insurers, pension funds and margin traders will likely remain active yen buyers despite Thursday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , limiting the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 's ability to make a weaker yen stick.\par \par \uc2 Yen demand from institutional investors hedging overseas investments as the global economic outlook grows more uncertain is compounding regular flows into the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  from manufacturers repatriating overseas earnings. The undiminished appetite for the yen means it may soon recoup Thursday's steep losses, dealers say.\par \par \uc2 "The \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  faces a tough battle in the months ahead while the situation with the U.S. economy and possible sovereign downgrades remains uncertain," said Koji Fukaya, director of global \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  research at \uc2 Credit Suisse\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Japanese institutional investors, forced by deflation and near-zero interest rates at home to pile into investments overseas, are growing increasingly nervous amid signs of global economic softening. Threats of sovereign rating downgrades in Europe and the U.S. are adding to their need to hedge assets held in foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 "The pension funds, life insurers and other Japanese institutional investors still have huge exposure overseas in \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  such as the dollar, euro and Australian dollar," said Tohru Sasaki, a \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist at \uc2 J.P. Morgan\uc2 . "They will continue to buy yen to hedge that exposure."\par \par \uc2 That comes on top of regular flows from exporters, the majority of which have to convert their foreign earnings back into yen for settlement purposes. Some exporters may postpone big yen purchases in hopes for more \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to give them a better deal.\par \par \uc2 Thursday marked the third time in the past year \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb yen strength, which makes Japanese cars, TVs and other products less competitive overseas.\par \par \uc2 But many exporters are ready to buy now after the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  pushed the dollar up to relatively attractive levels, from Y77.13 earlier to a three-week high at Y80.25. At 1100 GMT, the greenback was at Y79.80.\par \par \uc2 "With the dollar around Y80, naturally there are plenty of exporters ready to sell," said Shuichi Kanehira, a dealer at \uc2 Mizuho Corporate Bank\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 Overseas investors will also likely continue helping the yen. While many model hedge funds and other short-term investors overseas have no doubt been forced to trim their recently large accumulation of bets on the yen, any further turbulence in global financial markets could prod them to rebuild those positions.\par \par \uc2 -By Andrew Monahan, Dow Jones Newswires; 81-3-6269-2783; andrew.monahan@dowjones.com [ 04-08-11 1131GMT ]\par \par \uc2 1178 4256 4258 5095   \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJI0000020110804e7840014w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
