\par\par \b \uc2 UPDATE 2-Japan economy minister says G7 or G20 should discuss  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 By Stanley White   \par \uc2 475 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 August 2011\par 09:53\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 (Adds background)\par \par \uc2 TOKYO , Aug 4 (Reuters) - Japanese Economics Minister Kaoru Yosano pressed on Thursday for the Group of Seven or Group of 20 to hold talks on managing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves as \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  launched \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken the yen.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  acted a day after Switzerland's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  surprised financial markets by cutting interest rates in an attempt to weaken the Swiss franc.\par \par \uc2 Both countries have seen their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  driven higher by investors seeking a safe haven amid the worsening euro zone debt crisis and fears the United States is sliding back into recession.\par \par \uc2 Yosano, speaking to reporters, said \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  had been necessary because \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves had not reflected economic fundamentals.\par \par \uc2 "This is also a question of whether the yen is strong or other foreign \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are weak, so I think G7 and G20 officials will need to thoroughly discuss \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves from here on as a global issue," Yosano said.\par \par \uc2 Japanese authorities sold 1 trillion yen ($12.6 billion) on Thursday in their first \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market since March, as the yen threatened to reach a record high against the dollar.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's actions showed Tokyo would \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  again in response to big \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves, Yosano said.\par \par \uc2 The G20 has become the main forum for attempts to tackle imbalances in the global economy since leaders from major developed and emerging economies gathered in London in April 2009 to try and plot a way out of the 2008/09 financial crisis.\par \par \uc2 The last time \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  stepped into the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market, in March, it \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  jointly with other members of the G7 group of big developed nations. The latest \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been a solo effort.\par \par \uc2 Traders said the size of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  so far is estimated at more than 1 trillion yen, and some market players speculated that Japan's action could end up rivalling the 2.1 trillion yen in \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  it conducted on Sept. 15 of last year -- \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's biggest one-day yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  ever.\par \par \uc2 Last year, Brazil's Finance Minister Guido Mantega warned a "\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  war" was erupting as countries sought to weaken their \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support export growth.\par \par \uc2 That, and the Federal Reserve's quantitative easing programme, was blamed for fuelling hot money flows into emerging economies, fanning inflation and triggering interest rate rises.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  tensions are now returning to the fore, as renewed concerns about the health of the U.S. economy weighs on the dollar.\par \par \uc2 Economic data this week has painted a gloomy picture, with U.S. consumer spending falling in June for the first time in nearly two years and manufacturing growth in the United States, Europe and even China at a near standstill.\par \par \uc2 (Editing by Tomasz Janowski, Alex Richardson)\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 JAPAN\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 /G7 (UPDATE 2)   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110807e7840006j\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
