\par\par \b \uc2 Japan July foreign reserves at $1.15 trln\b0\par\par\uc2 212 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 August 2011\par 01:54\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 TOKYO, Aug 5 (Reuters) - Japan's foreign reserves rose to $1.15 trillion at the end of July, the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  said on Friday, hitting another record high.\par \par \uc2 Japanese authorities \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market on Thursday for the first time since March to curb rises in the yen that threatened to derail the export-reliant economy's recovery from a slump triggered by the March natural disaster.\par \par \uc2 In March, Japan used a total of 692.5 billion yen in \b \highlight22\uc2 forex\b0 \highlight\uc2  exchange \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  when Group of Seven (G7) countries joined it in their first joint \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in more than a decade after the yen shot to a record 76.25 yen to the dollar.\par \par \uc2 Last September, the authorities spent about 2.1 trillion yen on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the record for Japanese yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on a single day.\par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 JAPAN\b0 \highlight\uc2  OFFICIAL RESERVE ASSETS (in billion dollars) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par            END-JULY  END-JUNE    END-MAY    YEAR AGO\tab \par  TOTAL    1,150.877  1,137.809  1,139.524   1,063.513\tab \par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 To view the full tables, go to the MOF website at:\f28 \par \par {\field{\*\fldinst{HYPERLINK "http://www.mof.go.jp/international_policy/reference/official_reserve_assets/2307.html"}}{\fldrslt{\cf2 \uc2 http://www.mof.go.jp/international_policy/reference/official_reserve_assets/2307.html}}}\par \par \uc2 \f2 (Reporting by Kaori Kaneko; Editing by Joseph Radford)\f28 \par \par \uc2 JAPAN-ECONOMY/RESERVES   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020110805e7840001g\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw200\pich25\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3000\pichgoal375
