\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  MOF  \highlight22\uc2 Intervened \highlight\uc2  In  \highlight22\uc2 FX \highlight\uc2  Market\b0\par\par\uc2 By Andrew Monahan   \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 211 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 August 2011\par 03:28\par \uc2 Dow Jones Business News\par \uc2 DJON\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 TOKYO -(Dow Jones)- \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's government likely \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to curb yen strength in Tokyo on Thursday, sending the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  down sharply against the dollar, euro and other counterparts, three traders said.\par \par \uc2 At 0100 GMT, the yen began weakening suddenly, with the dollar jumping from Y77.13 to Y78.20 and the euro from Y110.72 to Y111.80.\par \par \uc2 The moves came amid speculation the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  could \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to curb the strong yen. The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's strength has clouded the outlook for Japan's export-driven economy as it recovers from the March 11 earthquake and tsunami.\par \par \uc2 Japanese authorities have recently ratcheted up their rhetoric against the soaring \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Finance Minister Yoshihiko Noda said Tuesday the yen is "strongly overvalued" and that Tokyo is consulting with overseas authorities on the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rise. A person familiar with the matter told Dow Jones Newswires the U.S. hasn't greenlighted any Japanese \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , but in a sign Tokyo could again go it alone, a separate source said Japan could step in "at any time."\par \par \uc2 -By Andrew Monahan, Dow Jones Newswires; 81-3-6269-2783; andrew.monahan@dowjones.com [ 08-03-11 2128ET ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJON000020110804e78400009\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
