\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  MOF Sold Y2T-Y4T In  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2  Thurs - Traders\b0\par\par\uc2 245 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 August 2011\par 01:50\par \uc2 Dow Jones International News\par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 TOKYO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold around Y2 trillion to Y4 trillion via Thursday's \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , traders said Friday, making it the nation's largest-ever yen-selling in a single day.\par \par \uc2 The large figure gave \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market participants the impression the authority is serious about preventing the yen from rising too much and may bid in the market again.\par \par \uc2 Traders said they were nearly certain Thursday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  exceeded the previous record of Y2.125 trillion marked Sept. 15 by a wide margin. They said the total amount was very likely more than Y2 trillion, but not more than Y4 trillion.\par \par \uc2 "By now, estimating the amount is almost an impossible task because Japan was so active in the market yesterday," one trader said. "The amount should be a record high for a single day, but I can only estimate it was between Y2 trillion and Y4 trillion."\par \par \uc2 Analysts will pay attention to changes in the daily current account balance data to be released by the Bank of Japan around 0900 GMT. They often use the data to estimate the amount of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on the previous business day.\par \par \uc2 Meanwhile, data from EBS show dollar/yen trading totaled $175 billion an all-time high. The Nikkei reported Friday the \b \highlight22\uc2 operation\b0 \highlight\uc2  had reached Y4 trillion.\par \par \uc2 