\par\par \b \uc2 Possible Yen  \highlight22\uc2 Intervention \highlight\uc2 --The Next Market Fixation\b0\par\par\uc2 By Andrew J. Johnson   \par \uc2 Of DOW JONES NEWSWIRES   \par \uc2 490 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 1 August 2011\par 23:25\par \uc2 Dow Jones Energy Service\par \uc2 NRG\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2011 Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 NEW YORK (Dow Jones)--With the dollar getting within a hair of its all-time nadir against the yen Monday, traders have turned their attention from the debt dispute in Washington toward the threat of yen-weakening \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 With the dollar last quoted at Y77.23, after falling as low as Y76.29 intraday-- just above the all-time low of Y76.25 hit in mid-March--many traders are questioning when and how--not if--Japanese officials will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to weaken their relentlessly rising \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 .\par \par \uc2 The range of "Y75-Y77 is [the] \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  zone," said Jens Nordvig, head of G10 \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategy at Nomura Securities in New York.\par \par \uc2 Japanese news agency Nikkei reported Monday that the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  is readying for \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  while the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has begun discussing additional monetary easing measures, which might also weaken the yen.\par \par \uc2 Senior Vice Finance Minister Fumihiko Igarashi said the Japanese government "will have to see what kind of measures the BOJ comes up with" in a regular two-day policy meeting ending Friday, before deciding on additional \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  measures on its part. Many Japanese companies have complained that the strong yen undermines their competitiveness and as a result, a number have decided to relocate \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2  offshore.\par \par \uc2 Even if the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  says it's deferring to the BOJ before making a decision, traders aren't taking for granted the possibility that the Ministry moves sooner. And the best guess, many say, is that Japanese officials pull the trigger sometime after U.S. lawmakers approve a resolution to raise the debt ceiling, expected Monday. That's because the dollar could be the recipient of a small boost as bulls breathe a sigh of relief that a U.S. fiscal disaster has been averted. And Japan's \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  would get more bang for its \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  buck by hitching a ride on the coattails of a rebounding U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , analysts say.\par \par \uc2 Indeed, timing and strategy will be all the more important this time, many say. That's because the Japanese government is expected to be on its own--unlike during the concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  that occurred in mid-March, when Group-of-Seven central banks joined with Japan to sell yen in the aftermath of the Sendei earthquake and tsunami. Unilateral \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  tends to have a lower success rate than coordinated efforts.\par \par \uc2 But unilateral \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  won't be easy, not when the risk of a downgrade to the United States' "AAA" rating threatens to keep weakening the dollar. Japanese officials "have to be prepared to do several rounds to convince the market that they are determined to fight the appreciation pressures," said Steven Englander, head of G10 strategy at \uc2 Citigroup\uc2  in New York.\par \par \uc2 -By Andrew J. Johnson, Dow Jones Newswires; 212-416-3092; andrewj.johnson@dowjones.com [ 08-01-11 1725ET ]\par \par \uc2 Dokument NRG0000020110801e7810003x\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
